    "text": "<p>In the given potentiometer circuit arrangement, the balancing length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AC</mi></math> is measured to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. When the galvanometer connection is shifted from point (1) to point (2) in the given diagram, the balancing length becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The ratio of the emf of two cells&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math> is:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0038b070-ef30-4751-a5fc-ff0d2d46f93c-image.png\" style=\"width: 285px; height: 209px;\" /></p>",
